      "properties": {
        "name": "Staten Island Expressway",
        "designation": "I-278 SI",
        "construction_year": 1958,
        "completion_year": 1964,
        "decade": "1960s",
        "neighborhoods_displaced": [
          "Sunnyside",
          "Willowbrook",
          "Grasmere"
        ],
        "description": "Built to connect the Verrazzano-Narrows Bridge (opened 1964) to the Goethals Bridge, the expressway cut through the center of Staten Island. It spurred massive suburban development on the island, transforming it from a semi-rural borough into a car-dependent suburb \u2014 exactly as Moses intended."
